# Backend Guidelines (Strapi)

- Strapi runs in `/backend`.
- Keep Content-Types simple and intuitive for non-technical dietitians.
- Use lifecycle hooks or custom controllers for appointment validation (e.g. slot availability checks).
- Prefer clear, domain-friendly field names over technical jargon in Content-Type schemas.
